# ======================
# Project Description
# ======================
abstract: |
  OpenLLM is an open-source platform for deploying and operating large language models (LLMs) in production.
  Key features include:
  - Support for 50+ open-source LLMs (LLaMA, Mistral, ChatGLM, etc.)
  - Unified REST/gRPC API and WebUI for model serving
  - Native integration with LangChain, Hugging Face, and BentoML
  - Cloud-native deployment via Kubernetes or serverless
  - Automatic OCI container generation
  - Optimized inference with vLLM, TGI, and custom backends

keywords:
  - "LLMOps"
  - "MLOps"
  - "Large Language Models"
  - "Model Serving"
  - "AI Infrastructure"
  - "Kubernetes"
  - "Serverless AI"
  - "REST API"
  - "gRPC"
  - "Hugging Face"
  - "LangChain"

